Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,187.2)}{\an7}Alternate Dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844.8,388.8)}{\an7}Keep Out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,547.2)}{\an7}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:17.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,In our society,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:19.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,a sedentary lifestyle...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,stress...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:24.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,and high-calorie foods are\Neverywhere you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:29.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,These factors negatively impact\Npeople's bodies on a daily basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.13,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,93.6)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:33.13,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,619.2)}{\an7}Beauty  Health  Diet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:35.00,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,604.8)}{\an7}The Elf of the Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:35.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:37.00,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(857.6,496.8)}{\an7}Tomoatsu Naoe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,I finished organizing those files.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:42.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,I've only got one more client\Non the schedule for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:46.08,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985.6,525.6)}{\an7}Akiho Ino
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:44.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,so go ahead and- oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:46.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Can you wait an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:47.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wanna go out for drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.33,0:00:51.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Boo! You're no fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:55.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,The boss tends to drink all night long,\Nand she gets handsy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:57.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,C'mon, have some!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Which isn't necessarily a bad thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:08.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,I have an appointment.\NMy name is Elfuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:09.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:10.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:13.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,M-my associate here will be helping you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:15.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:17.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Please, Naoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:19.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,The client is creeping me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:23.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm Naoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.75,0:01:27.33,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,223.2)}{\an7}Intake Form\N{\pos(473.6,374.4)}{\an7}Elfuda\N{\pos(320,424.8)}{\an7}Name
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:26.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,"Elfuda," eh?\NThat's a unique name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Y'think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:32.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,And you were interested in the Diet and\NBodywork Therapy program, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:34.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm in your hands now, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:39.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Emerald green eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:41.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's half Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:43.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Are there any specific areas\Nyou're concerned about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:48.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Lately, I've been feeling really insecure\Nabout my love handles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:50.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Same with my back...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:53.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Are... those her ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:57.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,I was never this size\Nwhen I ran through the meadows...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:01.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,I can't return to the forests of Kafar\Nlooking like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:02.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,The forests?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:04.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,The forests of where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.13,0:02:07.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,Plus she's got big ears and\Nemerald green eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:10.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,lives in a strange forest,\Nand her name is Elfuda...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's it! She's an ELF!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,No, no! That can't be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:16.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:19.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,M-my apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:22.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now, take off your jacket and\Nlie face down on the table for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.92,0:02:23.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:26.50,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,410.4)}{\an7}I ♥ GREASE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:35.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Y-you can leave your shirt on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:37.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,O-oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:40.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,My bad. I'm new to this,\Nso I don't know how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:42.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,All good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:43.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Then let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:49.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Everything alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:51.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yup, A-OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:54.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's my first time,\Nso it just startled me a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:56.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:02.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Sh-should I lighten up on the pressure...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:04.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Nah, dun worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:06.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel a fing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:08.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Pwease continue...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:12.75,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,93.6)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:12.75,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,619.2)}{\an7}Beauty  Health  Diet
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:20.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,I-I was so distracted by her reaction\Nthat I kinda overdid it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wait, her ears-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,You saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:25.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Uh, I-I saw nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:28.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,U-um, I swear it'll never leave this room!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:31.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,No use hiding it now that I've been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:33.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,The truth is that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.67,0:03:35.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,was an elf the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:36.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Behold my true form!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:44.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'll grab a spare shirt for you,\Nso go ahead and get changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:46.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,187.2)}{\an7}Alternate Dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:51.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844.8,388.8)}{\an7}Keep Out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,511.2)}{\an7}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:51.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,So... you traveled here through\Na portal from another dimension,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,but you can't get home\N'cause you gained weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Does that about sum it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.58,0:03:58.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,To traverse the portal that\Nconnects your world to mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.83,0:04:02.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,my weight must be the same\Nupon my return as it was when I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:04.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,By the way, why'd you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?! I came here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:08.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:09.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,To invade us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,...so that I could eat French fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:15.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's the reason you-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:17.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whaddya mean, "that's the reason"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:19.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,You humans might not realize this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:22.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,but the so-called "food" in our world\Nis overwhelmingly primitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.67,0:04:24.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Our options are "roast" or "boil."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:26.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,We basically eat raw ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:30.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Even seasonings like salt and pepper are\Nextremely rare, high-end luxury items!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Us elves happen to be vegetarians,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:35.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,but there's hardly any variety\Nin our diets in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:38.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Now take someone like me and\Ngive 'em human world flavors...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,You deep-fry sliced potatoes in oil
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:43.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,and cover them with salt\Nlike a shimmering layer of snow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:46.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,That crispy golden-brown crunch\Nis like heaven for my tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:49.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,French fries aren't junk food at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:52.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,They're a blessing from the gods above!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's why she's overweight...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:57.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,And they're insanely tasty,\Nso this happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:59.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,In other words, this woman- er, elf-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:03.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,is being inundated with foods\Nshe never even knew existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:05.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,That's why she eats in excess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:08.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,But then it dawned on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,If I got fat 'cause of this world's food,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:12.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,then I need this world's know-how\Nto get rid of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:16.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Human! As a resident of this world,\Nit's YOUR responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:17.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:20.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wait, where were you hiding that bow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:28.21,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thus began Elfuda's foray into\Ndeveloping a healthier lifestyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:34.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Alright, time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,You did great today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:37.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm beat...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:39.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda hungry, so I'll have a few-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:40.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,G-give me those!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:43.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,French fries are off-limits\Nwhile you're on a diet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:45.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,We're aiming for a plant-based lifestyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:47.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,But French fries are vegetables!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm vetoing your unfair rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:50.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Then how are you supposed to get home?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:53.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,We want a calorie deficit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:56.58,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's only for the duration of your diet,\Nso hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:05.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:07.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's that hard...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,We'll use dietary restrictions,\Nexercise, and osteopathy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:13.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,to improve your physiological balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:16.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,You'll see results so long as you\Nstick to the regimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.63,0:06:18.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,What if I only eat French fries once a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Don't bargain with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:24.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Hello again!\NYou've been working hard lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:25.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:28.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Swearing off French fries is more\Nmiserable than I anticipated...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:32.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,It'll be easier to burn fat once we\Nboost your metabolism a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:34.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Metabolism, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:35.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,In that case...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Look how big the tubs are!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,Stays empty at this time of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.75,0:06:44.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,Let's go get cleaned up and hop in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,No collecting firewood or drawing water...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,This world is so convenient...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:54.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,Half-body baths can help you\Nlose weight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:56.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:59.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,And targeting your problem areas with\Na massage while you're in the bath
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,doubles the effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.29,0:07:05.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'll take a nice hot tub\Nover a freezing river any day...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:08.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,Ahh, that's the stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:11.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,I soaked in there for\Na good thirty minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:12.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda thirsty, so I'll have a soda-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,We drink water on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:16.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.63,0:07:18.50,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,532.8)}{\an7}One month later
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:23.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:25.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,You look fantastic, Elfuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:26.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,I didn't even recognize you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Y-y'think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:31.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Well, it was all thanks to you, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:32.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:34.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,You're the one who put in all the hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:36.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,Also, it's "Naoe."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, what's with the outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:41.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,These are normal clothes in my home world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:42.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,So does that mean you're\Ngetting ready to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:47.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I can head back\Nthrough the portal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:48.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.29,0:07:53.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:57.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll eat one last helping of\NFrench fries before I hit the road...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:00.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't overdo it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:02.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:11.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Elfuda went home with a smile on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:14.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,I doubt I'm ever going to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:17.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,It makes me a little sad, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:20.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,we literally live in different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:28.25,Q2,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:37.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've eaten fast food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Elfuda's doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,I know how much she likes French fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:44.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,If she wanted, she could\Nmake some at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:47.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,But if she overeats and gains weight again-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,What?! Elfuda?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:59.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,I thought you went home already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:00.83,Q2,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,Then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:05.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,Whaddya mean? I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:08.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,You're under the impression that\Ninterdimensional travel is hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:16.25,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,187.2)}{\an7}Alternate Dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:16.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844.8,388.8)}{\an7}Keep Out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:16.25,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,511.2)}{\an7}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:13.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,But the portal itself is kinda like an\Nautomatic door with a weight limit, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:15.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's really not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:19.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... you went to\Nall the trouble of losing weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:20.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,and now you're right back\Nwhere you started!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:25.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,I learned something very important\Nfrom my most recent success:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Losing weight CAN be done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:31.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,Which means I get to eat as many\NFrench fries as I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:34.50,Q2,,0,0,0,,Because I can always\Nwork off the weight again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:38.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,This woman- er, elf-\Nhas only gotten worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:39.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,So, on that note...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:40.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:43.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,...I'm in your hands once again, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,It's "Naoe"...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:49.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,In our society, a sedentary lifestyle...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:53.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,stress, high-calorie foods, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:55.88,Q2,,0,0,0,,Have a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:10:01.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,...otherworldly species are\Neverywhere you look.
